<figure class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwAw"><span id="mwBA"><video poster="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Design_Academy_Eindhoven%2C_Graduation_Show_2013.webm/250px--Design_Academy_Eindhoven%2C_Graduation_Show_2013.webm.jpg?utm_source=nl.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser" controls="" preload="none" data-mw-tmh="" height="141" width="250" resource="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bestand:Design_Academy_Eindhoven,_Graduation_Show_2013.webm" data-durationhint="183" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBQ"><source src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d1/Design_Academy_Eindhoven%2C_Graduation_Show_2013.webm?utm_source=nl.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=original" type='video/webm; codecs="vp8, vorbis"' data-file-width="1280" data-file-height="720" id="mwBg"/><source src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d1/Design_Academy_Eindhoven%2C_Graduation_Show_2013.webm/Design_Academy_Eindhoven%2C_Graduation_Show_2013.webm.240p.vp9.webm" type='video/webm; codecs="vp9, opus"' data-width="426" data-height="240" data-transcodekey="240p.vp9.webm" id="mwBw"/><source src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d1/Design_Academy_Eindhoven%2C_Graduation_Show_2013.webm/Design_Academy_Eindhoven%2C_Graduation_Show_2013.webm.360p.mpeg4.mov" type='video/quicktime; codecs="mp4v"' data-width="640" data-height="360" data-transcodekey="360p.mpeg4.mov" id="mwCA"/><source src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d1/Design_Academy_Eindhoven%2C_Graduation_Show_2013.webm/Design_Academy_Eindhoven%2C_Graduation_Show_2013.webm.480p.vp9.webm" type='video/webm; codecs="vp9, opus"' data-width="854" data-height="480" data-transcodekey="480p.vp9.webm" id="mwCQ"/></video></span><figcaption id="mwCg"><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r70765578" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt2" id="mwCw" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Sjabloon:Taalaanduiding/styles.css"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"en","href":"./Sjabloon:En"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'>.mw-parser-output .taalaanduiding{font-family:sans-serif;font-size:85%;cursor:help;color:var(--color-subtle,#555)}.mw-parser-output .taalaanduiding span{border-bottom:1px dotted var(--color-subtle,#555)}</style><span class="taalaanduiding" title="Taal: Engels" about="#mwt2" id="mwDA">(<span>en</span>) </span><i id="mwDQ">Graduation Show Design Academy Eindhoven</i> in 2013</figcaption></figure>
<p id="mwDg"><b id="mwDw">Design Academy Eindhoven</b> is een school voor hoger beroepsonderwijs gespecialiseerd in vormgeving. De academie biedt een 4-jarige bacheloropleiding en verscheidene masteropleidingen aan op het gebied van <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Industriële_vormgeving" title="Industriële vormgeving" id="mwEA">industriële vormgeving</a>. De School voor Industriële Vormgeving - de eerste in Nederland - werd opgericht in 1955<sup about="#mwt4" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-1" id="mwEQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEw">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt5" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-2"}}'><a href="#cite_note-2" id="mwFQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFw">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGA">]</span></span></a></sup> door René Smeets, Kees Bol en Kees Houtman en werd later bekend onder de naam Akademie (voor) Industriële Vormgeving Eindhoven (AIVE).<sup about="#mwt6" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-3"}}'><a href="#cite_note-3" id="mwGQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwGg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGw">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt7" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-4"}}'><a href="#cite_note-4" id="mwHQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwHg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHw">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIA">]</span></span></a></sup> Die naam werd eind 1997 veranderd in Design Academy Eindhoven.</p>

<p id="mwIQ">Het Britse designmagazine <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICON?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="ICON (de pagina bestaat niet)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" id="mwIg" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["ICON"]}}'>ICON</a> plaatste de Design Academy Eindhoven in 2005 op nummer vijf van een door het blad samengestelde lijst van de invloedrijkste personen, producten en instellingen op het gebied van ontwerp van dat moment wereldwijd; op nummer tien stond de enige andere Nederlandse vermelding.<sup about="#mwt8" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-5"}}'><a href="#cite_note-5" id="mwIw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwJA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJQ">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

